<title>USA: Syquest names chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Syquest names chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>SyQuest Technology Inc Monday said it appointed John MacKay to the newly created position of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>It said MacKay was previously president and chief executive of Headway Technologies Inc which manufactures dual-strip, magneto-resistive read-write heads used in advanced disk drives.</p>
<p>MacKay has 30 years of experience in the electronics industry having spent more than a decade as a senior level executive at Western Digital Corp.</p>
